      "side": 1,
      "message": "The original threshold is closer to low-power charger. When the AP is off, the voltage difference on D- is so small that we sometimes misdetect the charger type inevitably. I\u0027m moving this threshold higher so that we more likely misdetect high-power charger as a low-power one, and not vice versa.",
